sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Teammate
  participant L as Log Hub
  participant S as SMTP relay
  T->>L: sign up (email, password)
  L->>L: check ALLOWED_EMAIL_DOMAINS, create unconfirmed account
  L->>S: confirmation email
  S-->>T: link = PUBLIC_BASE_URL/…
  T->>L: open the link
  L-->>T: account confirmed
  T->>L: sign in
